   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FAC201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.6</span>\n<h2>Student tasks & constructive questions</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">The rules you are held to (attendance, preparation, exam eligibility) — verbatim.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14510 · Decision 968/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 07/08/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FAC201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.6</span>\n<h2>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên & câu hỏi kiến tạo</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Những quy định bạn phải tuân theo (chuyên cần, chuẩn bị bài, điều kiện dự thi) — nguyên văn.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14510 · QĐ 968/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 07/08/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student tasks (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>- Students must attend more than 80% of contact slots in order to be accepted to the final examination.<br><br>- Student is responsible to do all exercises, assignments given by instructor in class or at home and submit on time<br><br>- Use laptop in class only for learning purpose<br><br>- Read the textbook in advance<br><br>- Access the course website (<a href=\"http://flm.fpt.edu.vn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://flm.fpt.edu.vn</a>) for up-to-date information and material of the course, for online supports from teachers and other students and for practicing and assessment.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>- Students must attend more than 80% of contact slots in order to be accepted to the final examination.<br><br>- Student is responsible to do all exercises, assignments given by instructor in class or at home and submit on time<br><br>- Use laptop in class only for learning purpose<br><br>- Read the textbook in advance<br><br>- Access the course website (<a href=\"http://flm.fpt.edu.vn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://flm.fpt.edu.vn</a>) for up-to-date information and material of the course, for online supports from teachers and other students and for practicing and assessment.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions (5)</h3>\n<p>Questions the syllabus asks you to think through before or during the session — try answering them yourself first.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo (5)</h3>\n<p>Câu hỏi syllabus yêu cầu bạn suy nghĩ trước/trong buổi học — tự trả lời trước khi xem bài.</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>Session<br><small>Buổi</small></th><th>Code<br><small>Mã</small></th><th>Question (verbatim)<br><small>Câu hỏi (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td>CQ1</td><td>Critique reporting integrity by simulating aggressive versus conservative impairment impacts on net assets</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td>CQ2</td><td>Compare financial ratio outcomes under alternative accounting treatments to evaluate investor decision-making</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td>CQ3</td><td>Use AI tools to extract and contrast competitor disclosures, assessing economic substance over form</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td>CQ4</td><td>Construct pro-forma consolidated statements for mid-year M&amp;A scenarios, adjusting for goodwill and NCI</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td>CQ5</td><td>Assess if management reporting choices prioritize investor transparency or obscure business risks</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14510\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14510</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14510\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14510</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
